message: "If you use LiveSearchBench, please cite the paper below."
title: "LiveSearchBench"
abstract: >-
  An automated pipeline that constructs continually updating,
  snapshot-grounded question answering benchmarks from Wikidata
  differentials, with SPARQL-verified answer uniqueness.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hengzzzhou/LiveSearchbench"
